r","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 44 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. In 2025 the middle got 40% of normal in Feb-Mar and 208% in Sep-Oct. So far in 2026 the middle has run under 90% in each published pair, with May to June at 63% in 2026. Grid 30719 had its driest year in 2006 at 51%.</p>"}
